# Keep the build context small and the layer cache stable: nothing here is
# needed to build an image (turbo prune copies only what each app needs).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/api/uploads
packages/db/src/generated

.git
.claude
.superpowers
docs
*.md

# Secrets and local config never go into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
